    "k": 1,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Section B. Interview.",
    "zh": "B节：访谈。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "interview"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen003.png",
    "sha256": "7cf2163cd2060cb77589726f3ddf2b529b6c293c411a393a9ef9b315a82615c3",
    "k": 2,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "In this section, you will hear two interviews.",
    "zh": "在这一节中，你将听到两段访谈。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "interview"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen004.png",
    "sha256": "555d39131b4f3042cd078c50ef2b923261fde96d0f4d6ea95e8456e092f8c8d5",
    "k": 3,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "At the end of each interview, five questions will be asked about what was said.",
    "zh": "每段访谈结束后，将就刚才所说的内容提出五个问题。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "question"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen005.png",
    "sha256": "1ec4e696ea0a34e9f1a2fd9e1b2c8ec2bf0e4bf48a6014963be4d5979282444b",
    "k": 4,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "Both the interviews and the questions will be spoken once only.",
    "zh": "访谈和问题都只读一遍。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "once"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen006.png",
    "sha256": "94911f00fd39f81749954cfc23501c3eb66457bc32cc00c2d84984a2bf996ed9",
    "k": 5,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "After each question, there will be a ten-second pause.",
    "zh": "每个问题之后会有十秒钟的停顿。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "pause"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen007.png",
    "sha256": "881efdd29874dcff282ebab1ffbb2543820a458850d6187238d191aebd0f2657",
    "k": 6,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "During the pause, you should read the four choices, of A, B, C, and D, and mark the best answer to each question on answer sheet two.",
    "zh": "请利用停顿时间阅读A、B、C、D四个选项，并在答题卡二上标出每题的最佳答案。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "choice"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen008.png",
    "sha256": "eaaa378746cba6902e4a15d52dd8b6fb696cbad94f07ba6ce0f6692b67d27973",
    "k": 7,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "instruction",
    "en": "You have thirty seconds to preview the choices.",
    "zh": "你有三十秒钟预览选项。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "preview"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen009.png",
    "sha256": "c78e73fc09c008c910d78153e64ec528e7d7b997e4ac6aa51b7dbe54a820fd4f",
    "k": 8,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Now listen to the first interview.",
    "zh": "现在请听第一段访谈。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "listen"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen010.png",
    "sha256": "99a770e698f96c83928b352e7c51bce95a940e9f1ee21efcf2ea8b62da1ab76f",
    "k": 9,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": "transition",
    "en": "Questions one to five are based on the first interview.",
    "zh": "第1至5题根据第一段访谈提问。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be based on"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen011.png",
    "sha256": "21945cd7f335cc793a851a88f39db98d74ad1929fdee0d9b95ffc54c82a170c1",
    "k": 10,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Good evening, everybody.",
    "zh": "大家晚上好。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "good evening"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen012.png",
    "sha256": "7316fb3057c97016b14c4fb9e11a4a2de68aaa42c269f5e674be8873c980b090",
    "k": 11,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Despite new promise of aid, international leaders provided disheartening assessments of the current battle against Ebola.",
    "zh": "尽管有了新的援助承诺，国际领导人对当前抗击埃博拉疫情的形势仍给出了令人沮丧的评估。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "disheartening"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen013.png",
    "sha256": "73620aca4c6b9d65d9d5aa7165a94aeab678a3fcaf232288175c133f7557b242",
    "k": 12,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The head of the World Bank said the international community—community had—“failed miserably” in its initial response.",
    "zh": "世界银行行长说，国际社会在最初的应对中“败得很惨”。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "fail miserably"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen014.png",
    "sha256": "e31aa23857f2b68b2fb64a921ddd1c4651b0fe61250d12efa27fc348c3ae2d4e",
    "k": 13,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The director of the Center for Disease Control said the situation reminded him of the early days of the AIDS epidemic.",
    "zh": "美国疾病控制中心主任说，这种情况让他想起了艾滋病疫情初起时的情形。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "epidemic"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen015.png",
    "sha256": "a06c8d89671ff6a514dc2f5deb1094c9d9ee6ecf25ffeb5f402095d9f86924e6",
    "k": 14,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "We get our own assessment from one of the few nongovernmental groups treating patients in West Africa.",
    "zh": "接下来，我们来听听在西非救治病人的少数几个非政府组织之一，如何评估当前形势。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "nongovernmental"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen016.png",
    "sha256": "1b6f5c27ad9d3055657db116f5ff03cfaf1f4dc9a50bdc3696040f7fadfa6210",
    "k": 15,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "International Medical Corps has built a treatment clinic in Liberia and is constructing other facilities in both Liberia and Sierra Leone.",
    "zh": "国际医疗队已经在利比里亚建起一家治疗诊所，并正在利比里亚和塞拉利昂建设其他医疗设施。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "facility"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen017.png",
    "sha256": "64dfb15668f8ddd37811303a74031ba416b79cf87786c7957cc1606ca950abf8",
    "k": 16,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Its president and CEO, Mary Johnson, joins me now.",
    "zh": "该组织的总裁兼首席执行官玛丽·约翰逊现在来到我们节目中。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "CEO"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen018.png",
    "sha256": "a8bf0fcbc190033002c7fb1d5997c26d8706c5ce9693151abaa5f3ee426621c3",
    "k": 17,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Thank you for joining us.",
    "zh": "感谢您参加我们的节目。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "join us"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen019.png",
    "sha256": "b285ba9e48116d4196d1d8fd608ec151661fb7edf3431dc5951bff93b904345d",
    "k": 18,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Thank you, Jack.",
    "zh": "谢谢你，杰克。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "thank you"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen020.png",
    "sha256": "77b78ccb71db0208ea5283f501966240ab79c9e0b264062065d95c22c8242517",
    "k": 19,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "How many beds, how many facilities, how many people would you say that you’re engaged in treating now?",
    "zh": "你们现在有多少床位、多少设施，大概正在为多少人提供治疗？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "be engaged in"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen021.png",
    "sha256": "2423c76c14cb7bd4a86afbe6e12301e36a4959744d088074edf0f85a7390a6bb",
    "k": 20,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "OK.",
    "zh": "好的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "ok"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen022.png",
    "sha256": "c774633f4091a828a229d91baee368968b65ba2c51aa73c8584a2b96b41332b2",
    "k": 21,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So, in Liberia, International Medical Corps opened up a 70-bed hospital —or actually we call it a treatment unit.",
    "zh": "在利比里亚，国际医疗队开办了一家有70张床位的医院——准确地说，我们称之为治疗中心。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "treatment unit"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen023.png",
    "sha256": "497f74124786f83e2c3b2117ee5ef81b3ff05f1ad5504326bb1bb2d7d911d7e5",
    "k": 22,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "We opened that up in mid-September.",
    "zh": "我们在九月中旬开始运营。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "mid-September"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen024.png",
    "sha256": "710a7c450ad72813668e1829be34ba622c6f3423a644b59f7967d0c8ed8759cf",
    "k": 23,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "We are scaling up and we will be opening up another treatment unit in Sierra Leone.",
    "zh": "我们正在扩大规模，还将在塞拉利昂开设另一个治疗中心。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "scale up"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen025.png",
    "sha256": "0ade99ec341983078d8c869547bd302b173a79512af193ca62bda1f527644667",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "In Liberia, we have about 200 people working in this treatment unit, trying to contain it, as well as treating people who have Ebola, ",
    "zh": "在利比里亚，约有200人在这家治疗中心工作，努力遏制疫情，同时治疗埃博拉患者，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "contain"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen026.png",
    "sha256": "081df6822284a119401fcfe7542d507fd802b9dda1548a147877dec1f7ce7711",
    "k": 24,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "with the hopes that they will recover, and they are recovering when they receive treatment.",
    "zh": "希望他们能够康复；而患者接受治疗后也确实在逐渐康复。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "recover"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen027.png",
    "sha256": "c287ab1ed547e3e0e0cd83f02ea5610956ea22f65f57213c09a50533da19bfc0",
    "k": 25,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Do you have any sense that the progress of this disease is being—is slowing?",
    "zh": "您是否感觉到，这种疾病的发展势头正在——正在减缓？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "slow"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen028.png",
    "sha256": "3c129749892a72ac80c06f2bc0e2e3c763758346505019d2a6d433bac6ca66da",
    "k": 26,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, let me say that it’s clear that efforts, like ours and other organizations’, are working.",
    "zh": "我想说，很明显，我们以及其他组织所作的努力正在发挥作用。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "effort"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen029.png",
    "sha256": "7234e776b5cace7c961d2e0d3677418e09302b34b83031cca9fbe0e72be7062e",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "When there are treatment efforts, when there are health care workers to treat patients as they come in ",
    "zh": "只要开展救治，只要有医护人员来接诊患者",
    "vocabulary": [
      "treat"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen030.png",
    "sha256": "587496bd468784615054f28699b7f6196b00966e2591dc1b1bf201d50f980562",
    "k": 27,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 2,
    "role": null,
    "en": "—I mean, our first patients that arrived to our treatment unit, they died at the doorstep.",
    "zh": "——我是说，最早来到我们治疗中心的那些患者，就死在了门口。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "doorstep"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen031.png",
    "sha256": "67c2fac671af7f96ebe3e410d5db4f36b11e78d5c9228b0a86216f4db3b2ee4b",
    "k": 28,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "But now we see that patients are recovering, and they’re returning back to their families.",
    "zh": "但现在，我们看到患者在康复，而且正在回归家庭。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "recover"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen032.png",
    "sha256": "b46db8906a50a22a260311cdd10e86e6289c7efafeaf3ddf0fc65611bd40873c",
    "k": 29,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So any efforts around treatment and containment are working.",
    "zh": "所以，围绕救治和控制疫情所作的努力都有效果。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "containment"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen033.png",
    "sha256": "79f9851b1839a2932fcd736b6c507de92d47f85428a24b923aa2f3a15355c898",
    "k": 30,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The problem and the challenge is that there are just not enough operational efforts on the ground.",
    "zh": "问题和挑战在于，当地切实开展的救援行动还远远不够。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "on the ground"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen034.png",
    "sha256": "97b31d86ee9de6e88ad0f9cbb464ab5a40eb4b734de610ad2f4c3b170b9979f0",
    "k": 31,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "That’s the challenge.",
    "zh": "这就是面临的挑战。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "challenge"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen035.png",
    "sha256": "dbc569392113ce9a5cfc3c7f3dcb7b530c15820104ab1d2d568e8bd67ad9112b",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Is that because a lack of international action or non-governmental action, ",
    "zh": "这是因为国际行动或非政府组织的行动不足，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "action"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen036.png",
    "sha256": "d1e68528b77648796d2aa81c99c86f3ab5a1853b79fd66f628a11c97e6e442ca",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 2,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "or is it because the infrastructure in these communities is so difficult that even if you sent them 10 pop-up hospitals, ",
    "zh": "还是因为当地的基础设施条件太差，以至于即使送去十家临时医院，",
    "vocabulary": [
      "infrastructure"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen037.png",
    "sha256": "17127d2e5c36ceca58147b01d9f5b1eb62cf7cbc8551d87c4adb6f664742255d",
    "k": 32,
    "part": 3,
    "parts": 3,
    "role": null,
    "en": "they couldn’t build them?",
    "zh": "他们也无法建起来？",
    "vocabulary": [
      "build"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen038.png",
    "sha256": "d475dd64bb200e1b712c1305b81361e7f9a2792c9d9637b192d3c9ddba5222f9",
    "k": 33,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "OK.",
    "zh": "好的。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "ok"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen039.png",
    "sha256": "5743810f341830eee10a4463c535c89fc3c15fdf2a13aef525ff054bd56a5182",
    "k": 34,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "Well, it’s a number of factors.",
    "zh": "原因有很多。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "factor"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen040.png",
    "sha256": "395a33365c70e15382eee9bd2a3ea998bec223d47fef6e4e1fef4849d2b13fe0",
    "k": 35,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "One, certainly, the health care infrastructures are very weak in West Africa, under-resourced.",
    "zh": "第一，西非的医疗基础设施确实非常薄弱，资源也很匮乏。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "under-resourced"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen041.png",
    "sha256": "bfffa754a4d23fc0fe8bab1633b39693f7df001b37defe84426607d2160bec4d",
    "k": 36,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "They don’t have enough health workers.",
    "zh": "他们没有足够的医护人员。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "health worker"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen042.png",
    "sha256": "736f49daa13ca13878d3d1563c8e37b424a2e5df4a164c06e3ca3115bc54fa4b",
    "k": 37,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "That’s one thing.",
    "zh": "这是其中一个原因。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "one thing"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen043.png",
    "sha256": "a4094aeba1d2407f0e0ca60c140a06c48dd728c8b7428de1ce1169840fd0edb9",
    "k": 38,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "The second thing is the spread wasn’t contained more quickly some months ago.",
    "zh": "第二，几个月前，疫情传播未能得到更迅速的控制。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "spread"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen044.png",
    "sha256": "39fb6a77615ebe63888e22dd818c2c24efcb103c851d9ae6596259b90703355a",
    "k": 39,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "International donors are stepping up.",
    "zh": "国际捐助方正在加大行动力度。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "step up"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen045.png",
    "sha256": "cb0cc5645666682dc602cbff3a9cd871ba3242accb3c145ad05f879f0b972a84",
    "k": 40,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "In fact, our treatment unit in Liberia was made possible from a grant from USAID’s Office of Foreign Disaster Assistance.",
    "zh": "实际上，我们在利比里亚的治疗中心得以建立，靠的是美国国际开发署海外灾难援助办公室的一笔拨款。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "grant"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen046.png",
    "sha256": "1a57a120fa0921a4350e8ee2061b445eedd3f84612c0c0c6a836bde2b53b5d6a",
    "k": 41,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "It took $5 million to open that up and about a million a month.",
    "zh": "建起这个中心花了500万美元，之后每个月大约还要100万美元。",
    "vocabulary": [
      "a million"
    ]
  },
  {
    "file": "screen047.png",
    "sha256": "545324e5158278929965cec5fea62cf99d67099ca4eb01d1a3f550633844d07c",
    "k": 42,
    "part": 1,
    "parts": 1,
    "role": null,
    "en": "So, part of it is the resources need to be there, but also people are really afraid.",
    "zh": "所以，一方面必须有资源支持，另一方面，人们也确实很害怕。",
    "vocabulary": [
